WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.229
Week 14: Travel, Transport, and Lodging. reserve transport and lodging check in report delays and room problems

2
00:00:08.229 --> 00:00:21.516
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can reserve transport and lodging, check in, report delays and room problems. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:21.516 --> 00:00:28.998
Language system. Irregular present in travel; acabar de; tener que; sequencing future plans with ir a.

4
00:00:28.998 --> 00:00:35.541
Sound and delivery. Connected speech in numbers, times, reservation codes, and names.

5
00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:45.074
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:45.074 --> 00:01:11.695
Model language. El tren sale del andén cuatro. — The train leaves from platform four. Acabamos de llegar al aeropuerto. — We have just arrived at the airport. Tengo una reserva a nombre de Rivera. — I have a reservation under the name Rivera. Mi equipaje no aparece. — My luggage is missing. Vamos a quedarnos tres noches. — We are going to stay three nights.

7
00:01:11.695 --> 00:01:21.849
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
